OL,3,GNEWSADaniel Thomas in court accused of
OL,4,Aentering migrant site
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is also charged with entering or
OL,7,Fremaining in Dover Docks without having
OL,8,Flawful business or permission, the
OL,9,Fdocuments say.
